>63|4.4 LINEINPUT.INC.BL -- a positioned entry field
>75|4.14 KB.INC.BL -- the keyboard buffer, emptied
>65|4.6 MENUVERT.INC.BL -- a vertical menu
>70|4.9 MENUBAR.INC.BL -- a horizontal menu
>72|4.11 GUI.INC.BL -- four dialogs, in a box that puts the screen back
>73|4.12 GUI2.INC.BL -- a listbox, single or multi select
>86|STASH.INC.BL -- save a text rectangle, and put it back.
